      "rationale": "Definitional expansion of the named proof-harness term #callAdd into loading the exact translated add function and invoking it; the rule introduces no independent mathematical fact.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-421e63465e293edfd877e4482b1842e53422f4b5589c6d1a5f54e9d264066aa8",
      "start_line": 9,
      "text": "  rule <k> #callAdd(X:Int, Y:Int)\n        => #loadAll(\n             Module(\n               FuncDef(\"add\", Params(\"x\", \"y\"),\n                 Return(BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"x\"), Name(\"y\"))))))\n           ~> Call(Name(\"add\"), Int(X), Int(Y))\n           ...\n       </k>"
    }
